{
  "slug": "slop-gate",
  "name": "Slop Gate",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Deterministically and progressively prevent Claude from disregarding your instructions, drifting from intent, or deciding to give up and implement a hack to move things forward.\n\nIdentifies drift patterns via hooks and forces a self corrective introspection in the conversation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 agent**, **7 commands** and **7 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `reflect` (Reflect on a Claude Code mistake and update Slop Gate drift patterns when a reusable detection should be…)\n- **Agents** (1): `pattern-curator` (Reflect on Claude Code mistakes and append or extend Slop Gate drift patterns)\n- **Commands** (7): `audit-history` (Scan previous Claude Code transcript history for candidate intent-drift episodes), `dismiss` (Dismiss a Slop Gate drift pattern when it has produced a false positive in this session or project), `ingest-history` (Convert a Slop Gate history audit into append-only drift patterns), `intent` (Declare the goal and allowed/forbidden file scope for the current task so Slop Gate can flag scope creep…), `setup` (First-time Slop Gate setup for a Claude Code environment), `slop` (Flag a drift or assumption Slop Gate missed in the current session, propose a pattern update, and continue…), `verify` (Verify Slop Gate is installed, enabled, and ready for future Claude Code sessions)\n- **Hooks** (7): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUseFailure`, `TaskCreated`, `TaskCompleted`, `SubagentStop`, `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install slop-gate@claude-community` from `codeninja/slop-gate`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 7,
    "command": 7
  },
